 "sequence": 1,
 "what": "OWNER-PYTORCH-BACKEND-01 (RECON-TORCH-01): a recipe names its reconstruction backend, inference.backend = jax (default) or pytorch, realizing model_family.pytorch_backend, which moves from excluded to supported. Adds the PyTorch-only fno family (neuraloperator 2.0 Fourier neural operator over the time grid) and its n_modes surface; depth also sets FNO Fourier layers. The environment pin becomes the combined JAX + PyTorch backends environment. JAX recipes keep their strategy hashes and numerics; DEVELOPMENT only until the owner sets the PyTorch reproducibility tolerance, training limit and security acceptance."
